{
  "bookId": "hero-214104",
  "id": "bond-28591",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28591001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "嘿嘿，愉快的茶会要开始咯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "人类，用来装点心的高礼帽准备好了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好了，好了，这是我定做的礼帽形状的容器。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "哼……也行吧！那火烈鸟准备好了吗？茶会后可是还有槌球比赛的哟~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然，当然，这是定做的火烈鸟主题的餐具。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "总感觉有点违和啊……不过最重要的点心都做好了，就这样吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28591008",
              "text": "（太好了，点心不用放礼帽里了。）"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28591008",
              "text": "（还好，不用去抓真的火烈鸟。）"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28591007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "锁形状的果馅饼，蜂蜜满满的太妃糖……嗯~真不错！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "看样子茶壶里的奶茶也好了，我先来一杯，嘻嘻~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咕噜——咕噜——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "啊呸呸呸呸，怎么糖味就这么少！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28591013",
              "text": "不可以一次吃太多糖噢。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28591013",
              "text": "我少放了一点点糖。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28591012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "那槌球游戏，今天要玩到晚上！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我很乐意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "等你累趴下了，我就可以吃更多糖了，嘻嘻。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28591016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "喂！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
